# Core Module Definitions

## Module 1: Identity & Access
**Folder:** `src/modules/identity`

**Responsibility:**
- User authentication (OTP + JWT)
- Role management
- Permission management
- Session tracking
- Device management
- Password reset

**Owns Data:**
- `users`
- `roles`
- `permissions`
- `user_roles`
- `user_sessions`
- `user_devices`
- `password_resets`

**API Surface:**
```typescript
POST /api/v1/auth/otp/send
POST /api/v1/auth/otp/verify
POST /api/v1/auth/login
POST /api/v1/auth/logout
POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
GET  /api/v1/auth/me
GET  /api/v1/users/:id
PUT  /api/v1/users/:id
POST /api/v1/users/:id/roles
DELETE /api/v1/users/:id/roles
```

**Events Published:**
- `UserRegistered`
- `UserLoggedIn`
- `UserLoggedOut`
- `RoleChanged`

**Dependencies:**
- None (foundational module)

---

## Module 2: Segment Engine
**Folder:** `src/modules/segment`

**Responsibility:**
- Define platform segments (Textile, Spare Parts, Future...)
- Manage segment configs (attributes, filters, rules)
- Enforce cross-segment isolation
- Switch segment context
- Dynamic category tree per segment

**Owns Data:**
- `segments`
- `segment_configs`
- `segment_taxonomies`
- `category_trees`
- `segment_attribute_schemas`

**API Surface:**
```typescript
GET  /api/v1/segments
GET  /api/v1/segments/:id
GET  /api/v1/segments/:id/categories
GET  /api/v1/segments/:id/filters
POST /api/v1/segments/:id/switch
GET  /api/v1/segments/:id/attributes
```

**Events Published:**
- `SegmentCreated`
- `SegmentUpdated`
- `SegmentContextChanged`

**Dependencies:**
- Identity & Access (for segment access permissions)

---

