# Conclusion

This module breakdown defines a clean, testable, and scalable architecture for VyaparNet.

Every module is:
- Self-contained
- Has clear boundaries
- Communicates via defined APIs and events
- Can be extracted to a microservice in the future
- Is fully documented

This is the foundation for a world-class B2B commerce operating system.

