7. Workflow State Machine Definitions
Every major workflow must use explicit state machines.

Required State Machines:
- Order State Machine
- Procurement State Machine
- Fulfillment State Machine
- Payment State Machine
- Dispute State Machine
- Return State Machine

Rules:
- invalid transitions prohibited
- every transition audited
- transitions timestamped
- compensating transitions supported
8. Platform Security & Abuse Protection Engine
Folder: src/modules/platform-security

